<reference id="bacnet-BacnetConfigDeviceExt" xml:lang="en" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference ">
<title class="- topic/title ">Config container (bacnet-BacnetConfigDeviceExt)</title>
<shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">This frozen device extension under every <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetDevice</uicontrol> functions as the container for <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Config</uicontrol>-type
objects, which represent individual BACnet objects in the device.
By default, it contains a <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetDeviceObject</uicontrol> for the device’s sole <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetDevice</uicontrol> object.</shortdesc>
<prolog class="- topic/prolog ">
<metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">config</indexterm><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">BacnetConfigDeviceExt</indexterm>
</keywords></metadata>
</prolog>
<refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody ">
<section class="- topic/section "><p class="- topic/p ">A separate topic documents the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetDeviceObject</uicontrol>.</p></section>
</refbody>
</reference>